            <div xml:id="d511">

                <pb facs="0463" n="456" sameAs="frus:frus1937v03/pg456"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94/9560: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Commander in Chief, U. S. Asiatic Fleet</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Yarnell</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Chief of
                        Naval Operations</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Leahy</hi>)<anchor n="52"
                        xml:id="d511-f1"/></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1937-08-21T19:05:00+08:00">August 21, 1937—7:05
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received August 21—11:38 a.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>0021. Strongly recommended proposal of making any or all of Tsingtao a
                    “sanctuary” for the safety of the many Europeans and Americans now residing here
                    to your earnest consideration. At present both Chinese and Japanese authorities
                    in Tsingtao are earnestly striving to solve present difference. If the nations
                    most interested could unite in securing agreement to such a plan by the Chinese
                    and Japanese Governments it should be a godsend to several thousand Americans
                    and Europeans now here.</p>
                <closer>C[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ommander</hi>] <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                        >in</hi> C[<hi rendition="#small-caps">hief</hi>] A[<hi
                        rendition="#small-caps">siatic</hi>] F[<hi rendition="#small-caps"
                    >leet</hi>]</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
